[{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0066","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-0310","title":"Adobe Flash Player 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 存在内存地址信息泄露漏洞，攻击者可通过构造恶意的 Flash 内容（如嵌入在网页或 Office 文档中的 SWF 文件）触发该漏洞，从而绕过 Windows 系统的 ASLR 地址随机化保护机制，实现内存地址泄漏或远程代码执行。受影响版本包括 Windows 和 macOS 平台上的 13.0.0.262 及更早版本、14.x 至 16.0.0.287 之前版本，以及 Linux 平台上的 11.2.202.438 及更早版本。攻击者需诱导用户使用受影响的 Flash Player 打开恶意网页或文档，利用该漏洞可实现任意代码执行并完全控制用户系统。该漏洞于 2015 年 1 月被发现在野外活跃利用，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Adobe 已在后续安全更新中修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至 16.0.0.287 或更高版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-0310"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-01-23T21:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:19:57Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至安全版本：Windows 和 OS X 用户升级到 13.0.0.262 / 16.0.0.287，Linux 用户升级到 11.2.202.438；如无法立即升级，请在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件作为临时缓解措施。由于 Flash Player 已于 2020 年底终止支持，建议彻底卸载该组件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsb15-02.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/62452","http://secunia.com/advisories/62601","http://secunia.com/advisories/62660","http://secunia.com/advisories/62740","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201502-02.xml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/72261","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1031609","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/issues/196","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-0310","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-0310.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c56d78ae41d8368dc9c61cbfd15221820d154186/2015/0xxx/CVE-2015-0310.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-0310","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CVE-2015-0310-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/thdusdl1219/CVE-Study/blob/6bc0a2f8bf5ddd6089bc9ce2218